WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.763
Welcome.

2
00:00:00.763 --> 00:00:05.517
This briefing comes from Book 02 of
the Federal Modernization Workbook,

3
00:00:05.517 --> 00:00:09.875
Identity and Directory: the move
from Active Directory to Entra ID.

4
00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:14.812
What Book 02 accomplishes is a directory
where an object's place in the tree has

5
00:00:14.812 --> 00:00:19.825
become attributes and rules, and every
service account has an owner and a target.

6
00:00:19.825 --> 00:00:21.596
Of the workbook's four tracks,

7
00:00:21.596 --> 00:00:25.875
it carries the directory side of the
HR track and the service accounts.

8
00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:33.325
People's attributes are Book 03, devices
and servers Book 05, and AI agents Book 17.

9
00:00:33.325 --> 00:00:37.385
We'll take it through four
questions: why identity matters now,

10
00:00:37.385 --> 00:00:40.887
what changes, who owns which
decisions, and how to do it.

11
00:00:40.887 --> 00:00:43.850
The short version: this
isn't a directory upgrade.

12
00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:47.062
It decides whether every
later control actually works.

13
00:00:47.062 --> 00:00:48.380
Let's start with why.
